      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i think i have some antibiotic ointment in the first aid kit. do you think i'm good though? i mean i haven't had a tetanus shot in like 10 years or something, but it's just a little puncture, surely that's not a huge deal if i keep it clean and use the ointment right? i'd rather just stay home and keep an eye on it.",
